  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "source_text": "汚れも悩みもスッキリ解決！\nお掃除解決隊～！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-2:text",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "本日お掃除する部屋は、こちら……。\nこれは、見事に散らかったリビングですね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ずいぶん掃除のし甲斐があるな。よし、北村と\n古論は、床の荷物をどけてくれ。足場を作りたい。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "わかりましたー。細かい掃除は雨彦さんに任せて、\n僕は僕の出来ることをやりますねー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "しかし、本当に酷いな。見ろ、\n窓の掃除をろくにしていないせいで、カビの巣窟だ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "た、確かにものすごい有様ですが。\n雨彦……流石に少し、言い過ぎなのでは？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ほう……それじゃ、アレも放っといていいのかい？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "見てみな。古論の好きな魚が、\n荷物に埋もれて大変な事になってるぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "こ、これは……カクレクマノミのぬいぐるみ！\nああ、どうしてこんなひどいことに……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "海水魚の中では丈夫ではありますが、\n本来の住処はイソギンチャクです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-29:text",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "このように汚染された環境に居させるのは\n心苦しい……。すぐに救出しなくては！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 29
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（ふっ、番組プロデューサーも笑ってるな。\n2人も、いつもの調子が出てきたようだ）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-34:text",
        "step_id": 34,
        "step_index": 33,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 33
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "よし、それじゃ次は、天井の掃除だ。\n北村、古論、準備はできてるか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_j:step-36:text",
        "step_id": 36,
        "step_index": 35,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 38,
          "target_step_index": 35
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "source_text": "任せてください！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
